# - Qobuz, Shanika interpreter page and Music Story biography (opened 2026-10-20): versatile West Indian singer from Guadeloupe, music since childhood, covers then own tracks in shatta dancehall or bouyon style, Kay ve yo (2023) attracted particular attention, performed in France, Germany, Guyana, collaborations with the HollyG trio and Mr Vegas. Full release list with dates and labels (Voodoo Studio, Aztec Musique, MF Music, VGM PRODUCT, 5400436 Records DK).
