# - Caraib Creole News, interview with Maite Berchel-Bordin (opened 2026-10-20, published 2025-12-13): Shanika named among the most emblematic current bouyon artists in Guadeloupe, with Lejuh, 1T1, Theomaa and Aknose.
# - NRJ Antilles (opened 2026-10-20): 5 KILOS presented as a new hit signed Lewismelo, Admiral T and Shanika.
